  "grimoire/iron-covenant-25": {
    "body": "## Collector’s margin\n\nThe holds’ praised endurance depended on client valleys for food. A fertile resource card keeps those suppliers within a history too easily told only through forges.",
    "related": [
      "chronicle/iv-the-age-of-crowns"
    ],
    "choices": []
  },
